---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import { membership } from '../data/membership.mjs';
import '../styles/membership.css';
---
<Platform canonicalPath="/shop" title="Shop: instant launch spots and membership" description="Two one-time purchases: a $3 instant launch spot, or a $5 Digivated Membership with full access: a member badge, News, the Prompt Packet, and member guides.">
<div class="shop">
  <section class="dg-hero shop-hero" aria-labelledby="shop-title">
    <pre class="ascii-field home-workshop dg-hero-ascii" data-ascii-field aria-hidden="true"></pre>
    <div class="dg-hero-copy">
      <p class="dg-pill"><span class="dg-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Shop</p>
      <h1 id="shop-title">Two ways to <span class="dg-hero-accent">get seen.</span></h1>
      <p class="dg-hero-lede">Pay once, no subscriptions. Launching is always free.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="shop-grid">
    <article class="shop-card shop-spot" aria-labelledby="shop-spot-title" data-shop-spot>
      <p class="shop-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">⚡</span> Instant spot</p>
      <h2 id="shop-spot-title">Go live today</h2>
      <p class="shop-for">For one launch you want out now.</p>
      <div class="shop-price"><strong data-shop-spot-price>$3</strong><span>once</span></div>
      <ul class="shop-list">
        <li>Live the moment you pay</li>
        <li>Homepage spot for 7 days</li>
        <li>No queue, no badge needed</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="button primary shop-cta" href="/submit-project?spot=1#project-form" data-shop-spot-cta>Claim a spot <UiIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></a>
      <p class="shop-note" data-shop-spot-note hidden></p>
    </article>

    <article class="shop-card membership-offer" aria-labelledby="shop-member-title">
      <p class="shop-kicker shop-kicker-member"><span class="dg-member-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span> Membership</p>
      <h2 id="shop-member-title">Become a member</h2>
      <p class="shop-for">Members get full access to everything on Digivated.</p>
      <div class="shop-price membership-price"><strong>${membership.priceUSD}</strong><span>once</span></div>
      <ul class="shop-list membership-benefits">
        <li>A member badge on your project</li>
        <li>One reviewed project spotlight</li>
        <li>Full News access, including the archive and market snapshot</li>
        <li>The full UI/UX Prompt Packet</li>
        <li>Full member guides</li>
      </ul>
      {membership.checkoutReady ? <a class="button primary membership-checkout shop-cta" href={membership.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once <UiIcon name="external" size={17}/></a> : <><button class="button primary membership-checkout shop-cta" disabled>Checking checkout…</button><p class="membership-checkout-note shop-note" role="status">Loading checkout. Give it a second.</p></>}
      <p class="shop-note">Checkout is on Gumroad. Then verify below.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section id="member-sign-in" class="membership-access" aria-labelledby="membership-access-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Already a member?</p><h2 id="membership-access-title">Verify your purchase</h2><p>Use your Gumroad email or license key.</p><p id="membership-verified" hidden>You’re verified. <a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your member project</a>.</p></div><div><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button" type="submit">Verify membership</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of membership</button></div></section>

  <section class="membership-faq" aria-labelledby="membership-questions"><h2 id="membership-questions">Questions</h2>
    <details><summary>Which one should I pick?</summary><p>Want one project live today? Get a spot. Want full access, a member badge, News, the Prompt Packet, and member guides? Become a member.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is anything a subscription?</summary><p>No. Both are one-time payments. Nothing renews.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How does the member badge work?</summary><p>Sign in and pick Membership when you submit. We take a quick look at your logo, description and link, then your project shows the member badge. Paying doesn’t skip review or promise traffic.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I open the Prompt Packet?</summary><p>Verify above, then open the Packet. You can also use your license key at <a href="/access">digivated.com/access</a>.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can I read News first?</summary><p>Yes. <a href="/news">Five stories are free</a>. Verify your membership to read the rest.</p></details>
    <details id="previous-purchases"><summary>What about a previous purchase?</summary><p>Older purchases still work. <a href="/access">Open your Prompt Packet</a> or use the form above. Bought a promotion? <a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Submit it for review</a>.</p></details>
  </section>
</div>
<script>import '../scripts/membership-access.js'; import '../scripts/membership-checkout.js'; import '../scripts/shop.js';</script>
</Platform>
